3.7 Population Distribution by Place of Residence
More than one third (34.9 percent) of Tanzania’s population resides in urban areas and 65.1
percent in rural areas. Similar pattern is observed in Tanzania Mainland while about half of
the population (49.0 percent) in Tanzania Zanzibar were living in urban areas (Figure 3.19).
