Table 3.4 presents the distribution of population by rural-urban and five-year age groups.
The proportion of young population (below age 15) in rural areas was higher (46.0 percent)
than that of urban areas (37.0 percent). On the other hand, the proportion of youth
population (15 - 24 years) in urban areas was higher (21.3 percent) than in rural areas (18.1
percent). The same pattern was observed for Tanzania Mainland (see Table 3.5) and
Tanzania Zanzibar (see Table 3.6).
