Key Message Box 5:
Increasing proportion of urban population is due to rural-urban migration and
recategorization of rural areas into urban.
The results further reveal that, apart from Dar es Salaam Region which is all urban, Mjini
Magharibi has the highest proportion (79.5 percent) of persons residing in urban areas. On
the other hand, Kagera Region has the lowest percentage (11.2 percent) of people living in
urban areas (Map 3.5).
